    "80_2018_L": "6\nBill No. 80-F of  2018\nO                                                                                                                       ORIGINAL\nORIGINAL\nTHE APPROPRIATION (No. 2) BILL, 2018\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT—\nLOK SABHA ON 14 MARCH, 2018\nDEEMED TO HAVE BEEN PASSED BY\nTHE HOUSES ON 29 MARCH, 2018)\nASSENTED  TO\nON 29 MARCH, 2018\nACT NO. 14 OF 2018\n\n1\nTHE APPROPRIATION (No. 2) BILL, 2018\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT)\nA\nBILL\nto authorise payment and appropriation of certain sums from and out of the Consolidated\nFund of India for the services of the financial year 2018-19.\nBE it enacted by Parliament in the Sixty-ninth Year of the Republic of India as\nfollows:—\n1. This Act may be called the Appropriation ( No. 2) Act, 2018.\n2. From and out of the Consolidated Fund of India there may be paid and applied\nsums not exceeding those specified in column 3 of the Schedule amounting in the  aggregate\nto the sum of Ninety-four lakh sixty-one thousand five hundred twenty-four crore and\neight lakh rupees towards defraying the several charges which will come in course of\npayment during the financial year 2018-19 in respect of the services  specified in column 2 of\nthe Schedule.\n3. The sums authorised to be paid and applied from and out of the Consolidated\nFund of India by this Act shall be appropriated for the services and purposes expressed in\nthe Schedule in relation to the said year.\n4.  References to Ministries or Departments in the Schedule are to such Ministries\nor Departments as existing immediately before the 13th September, 2017 and shall, on or\nafter that date, be construed as references to the appropriate Ministries or Departments as\nreconstituted from time to time.\nShort title.\nIssue of\nRs. 9461524,08,00,000\nout of the\nConsolidated\nFund of India for\nthe financial year\n2018-19.\nAppropriation.\nConstruction of\nreferences to\nMinistries or\nDepartments in\nthe Schedule.\nBi